' The trader's temporary space. After hiring (the meat is spent) the pack is
' bottle, knife, canteen. Set the knife aside, take it back, set it aside
' again and leave: nothing lost, nothing doubled.
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
clickon 248
hire                     ' paid with the meat
trade
trade                    ' at the trader's
rsceneclick 88,119       ' the knife aside: the canteen shifts down
save                     ' refused: something is set aside
sceneclick 172,16        ' the knife back, to the end of the pack
rsceneclick 88,119       ' the canteen aside this time
esc                      ' leave: the canteen comes back
save
